DESCRIPTION:Topic	:	Zumba x Bollywood	\nSynopsis	:	Looking for a fun and ch
	ill way to sweat out the stress from the day? Join us for Zumba X Bollywoo
	d dance workout to boost your cardio endurance\, improve core strength\, a
	nd unwind your body with us!	\nSpeakers	:	Mr Ajay Surendra Mathur\, Head o
	f CBG & Wealth Mgmt (HKMC member)\nMs Betty Lam\, Head of HR (HKMC member)
	\nMs Maggie Yung\, Dept Head\, Treasures & Distribution\, CBG\nMs Maggie D
	u\, Dept Head\, Deposits & Secured Loans\, CBG\nMr George Iu (External Ins
	tructor)\n	\n\n___________________________________________________________
	___________________________________________________\n\nOption 1 – If you
	 are joining via a laptop or mobile device through the application:\n1. Cl
	ick on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link  <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.ph
	p?MTID=m1adfa73e1d39e3b2b688a2b772239d2e> \n2. Use a headset for a better 
	experience\n*Visit here  <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/Site
	Pages/fow/digital-tools.aspx?market=Singapore&category=Communication> to f
	ind out more about Webex \n\nMeeting password: ktPtvawt827 (only if asked)
	\n\nOption 2 – If you are joining via Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch
	 Panel to dial in\n1. Press the "Call" icon\n2. Dial 25189162772@dbs.webex
	.com <mailto:25189162772@dbs.webex.com>  into the search bar and press "Ca
	ll" \n3. If you are the host\, enter your 6-digit one-time Host KEY. Click
	 here to see how to retrieve your Host KEY  <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.c
	om/sites/sgFOW/Shared Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fsites%2Fsg
	FOW%2FShared%20Documents&id=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides
	%2FWebEx%2FUser%20Guide%5FHost%5FPIN%2Epdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47%2D42f0%2
	Dbd84%2Db790e52deffa&parent=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides
	%2FWebEx> \n\nOption 3 – If you are joining via a laptop through the Web
	 browser: \nFor external parties who do not wish to download the applicati
	on \n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link  <https://dbs.webex.co
	m/dbs/j.php?MTID=m1adfa73e1d39e3b2b688a2b772239d2e> \n2. Click on ‘Cance
	l button’ if a popup ‘Open Webex?' appears \n3. Click on ‘Join from 
	your browser’ \n4. Enter your Name and Email Address and join the meetin
	g \n\nClick here  <https://help.webex.com/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/Join-a-We
	bex-Meeting> to find out more\n\nOption 4 – If you are dialling in via p
	hone (audio only):\n*Toll charges / Long distance charges may apply.\nNote
	 if you are the host\, please use either Option 1 or 2 to start the meetin
	g.\nSingapore +65-3157-6442 <tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\,%23> \nHong Kong
	 +852-3018-6828 <tel:%2B852-3018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Mumbai +91-2
	2-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-22-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Hyderabad +91-
	40-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-40-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiwan +886-2-5594-08
	39 <tel:%2B886-2-5594-0839\,\,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Number: 2518 916 2772
	#\nGlobal call-in numbers  <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php> \n
	\n\nUseful Links:\nNeed help? Contact Webex Support Team!  <mailto:webexsu
	pport@dbs.com> \n\n
